<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">1 TESALONIKA</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tes</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wuntete wu Pawuli ku bisi-Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wuntete wu Pawuli ku bisi-</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wuntete wusonika Pawuli ku minkwikidi mi mbanza Tesalonika. Pawuli wuyenda koko, na wubalonga Musamu Wumbote wu Yesu-Klisto (tala mu Mav 17.1-10). Bantu bakwe zakalanga koko balanda nzila yi Klisto. Kansi ku manima ma mwa ntangu kwandi, mwa ndambu yi Bayudayo yiba koko, yisindisila bantu mu nangumukina Pawuli na mukundi andi. Minkwikidi ni misweka Pawuli na zinkayi zandi. Mu mpimpa, babadukisa ha kimosi nawu, na Pawuli wuyenda na zinkayi zandi ku Beele.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ku manima ma mimvu myole, Pawuli wutambika Timote mu kwe tala bonso budi mavimpi ma Minkwikidi mi Tesalonika. Timote bu kayenda, wuvutuka, wuta ku Pawuli ti bana tatamana mu landa nzila, kansi bahiika mu yawu bana bisa mu sala mu baka bima bye dya. Ebu bana kwe te ti: ka hasiidi andi ntangu yiyingi ko Yesu wuna vutuka, tala ti basedi, buna kisalu kimpamba. Bahiika zimpeve zawu zii na kizunu ko, mu dyambu ti babingi mu matata na zingudi zawu na bakundi bawu bamana fwa, mpe Yesu kana vutuka ko. Ni hahoho Pawuli kabasonikina mu basyamisa na mu bateela bonso bwaabeela mvutukulu yi Yesu mpe nki Yesu kaasa ku yobobo bakwe musilanga kiminu. Buna balenda tatamana mu sa kivuvu ti baaba na Mfumu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (1.1)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Bwedi bisi Tesalonika bakwikila (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1.2–3.13</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Luzingu lukwe yangikanga Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Kivuvu mu mvutukulu yi Yesu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13–5.11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Malongi na mbote zimanunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-28">5.12-28</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Meno Pawuli, Silasi na Timote, tusonikini ku dibundu dii ku mbanza yi Tesalonika divwihulu ku Tata Nzambi, na ku Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. Bika Nzambi kalusakumuna na kaluhaana kiyenge!<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kizingu na kiminu ki bisi-Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Tukwe tatamananga mu vutula matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno, mpe tukwe lusambidilanga. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ntangu zimvimba tuna bambukanga moyo mu bisalu bi kiminu kyeno, mu bisalu bi luzolo lweno na mvibudulu yi kivuvu kyeno mu Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto, ha ntadisi yi Nzambi Tata dyeto. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Zimpangi, tuzebi ti Nzambi wulutiidi, na wulusoola, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />mu dyambu ti, ka mu mpova kaka ko tulusamunina Musamu Wumbote, kansi mu lulendo na mu Mpeve Yilongo, mpe mu kivuvu kimvimba. Luzebi bwedi bubela nkadulu eto ha kati dyeno, mu dyambu dyeno. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Yeno mpe luna landa kifwani kyeto na ki Mfumu, mu dyambu ti mpeleko mpasi ziba neeno, lutambula Mambu ma Nzambi mu kyese, kyese kifuma ku Mpeve Yilongo. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ni hahoho, luhikidi kifwani kimbote ku minkwikidi mimvimba mi kizunga ki Masedwani na ki Akayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Mu dyambu ti, Mambu ma Mfumu mamwangana tuka ku yeno, ka ku kizunga ki Masedwani na ki Akayi kaka ko, kansi nsangu zi kiminu kyeno mu Nzambi, zimwangana mu bibuka bimvimba: bwabu tuu na nsatu mu bwesa zonzila wo ko. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Bantu bamvimba bana kwe zonzi bwedi lutubwanini mu ntangu yi tubedi ku yeno, mpe bwedi lubiikidi mu sambila biteki mu bangumuka ku Nzambi, mwanki lumusadila, Yandi wuu Nzambi yimoyo na yikedika. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Mpe, mu kingila Mwana andi wuna fuma ku mazulu, Yesu wukafulukisa mu bafwa, kwe tukuulanga mu nganzi zina kwiza.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki Pawuli ku mbanza Tesalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Zimpangi, walutomini zaba yebende ti, ka mumpamba ko tuyizila kuu yeno. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Waluzebi ti, tekila tutula ku yeno, bamana tutuka na kuyenisa mpasi ku mbanza yi Filipi. Kansi Nzambi wutuhaana kibakala mu samuna kuu yeno Musamu Wumbote mu kati di zimvita zizingi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Mambu ma tululonga maa ma luvunu ko, maa ma makani mambi ko, mpe maa ma madyela mambi ko, <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />kansi budidi ti ni Nzambi wuyena ti balunga tudi mu tuhaana kiyeko ki Musamu Wumbote, tuna longa, ka mu dyambu dye yangidika bantu ko, kansi mu yangidika Nzambi kwe talanga mitima. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Waluzebi ti, tusadila nzonzolo ye luleba ko, tuba mpe na mayindu me ludya mbongo ko. Nzambi mbangi eto kadi. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Tusosa dyaka nkembo wu kwe fumanga ku bantu ko, ni kuba ku yeno ni kuba ku bantu bahiika. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Mpeleko tuba na luve mu sadila bumfumu bweto kuu yeno bonso zintumwa zi Klisto, kansi tukikulula ha kati dyeno, bonso ngudi bu kakwe bongilanga baala bandi. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Mu dyambu di luzolo lweto mu yeno, tuba bakubama mu luhaana, ka Musamu Wumbote kaka ko, kansi mpe luzingu lweto. Kadi yeno luyiza ba ku yeto bantu nkatika bamfunu. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Zimpangi, bambukeeno moyo mu mpasi zeto na lebakani dyeto: mu ntangu yi twedi lusamuninanga Musamu wumbote, twedi salanga mpimpa na mwini, mu lembolo ba kizitu ku muntu ha kati dyeno.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Yeno mbangi ludi na Nzambi mpe, ti nkadulu eto ku yeno minkwikidi yiba yivedila, yilunungu na yilembolo ba na kibila. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Luzebi ti tuba ku kadi muntu mu yeno, bonso tata kakwe sanga mu baala bandi. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Tulusyamisa, tulukindisa, na tululomba mu ba na nkadulu yifwanakani ha meso ma Nzambi, wuna lutumisa ku Kimfumu kyandi na ku nkembo andi.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ni hahoho, yeto mpe tuna tatamana mu vutulanga matondo ku Nzambi mu musamu ewu: bu tulusamunina Mambu ma Nzambi, yeno luyuwa mo na lutambula mo, ka bonso mambu ma bantu ko, kansi bonso Mambu ma Nzambi bu madi mu bukedika. Bwabobo makwe sadilanga mu yeno minkwikidi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Yeno zimpangi, lulendi kifwani ki Mabundu ma Nzambi mu Yesu-Klisto maa mu kizunga ki Yuda. Bantu ba nsi eno baluyenisa mpasi, zazozo mpe Bayudayo bayenisa ku mabundu ma nsi yi Yuda. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Yawu bahonda Mfumu Yesu na mimbikudi, ni yawu batuyenisa mpasi. Bayangidikanga Nzambi ko, mpe mitantu mi bantu bamvimba badi. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Bana tukakidila mu longa ku balembolo ba Bayudayo Mambu malenda bavuukisa. Mu bobobo, bana tatamana mu bwesa kitezo ki masumu mawu. Kansi ku nsukunu, nganzi zi Nzambi zi babwididi.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mabanza ma Pawuli mu bwesa yena bisi Tesalonika.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Zimpangi, tuhambana neeno mu mwa ntangu, mu nsuni kansi ka mu mabanza ko, tusiidi ngolo mu bwesa luyena, mu dyambu ti tuba na mpwila yiyingi mu bwesa luyena. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Twedi sosanga mu kwiza kuu yeno ka mu nkumbu yimosi kaka ko, vula-vula meno Pawuli, kansi Satana wedi tukakidilanga. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Banani baa kivuvu kyeto, kyese kyeto, hoti dyaka masiika meeto e? Ka yeno ko ha ntadisi yi Mfumu eto Yesu, bu kaakwiza e? <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ninga, yeno ludi nkembo eto na kyese kyeto!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Bu tuyeni ti tulendi bwesa vibidila mu lembolo luyena ko, tubongidi nzengolo mu saala ku Ateni yeto hiika, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />mpe tulutambikidi Timote, mpangi eto yi kisalu ki Nzambi mu samuna Musamu Wumbote wu Klisto, mwanki kalusyamisa na kalukindisa mu dyambu di kiminu kyeno, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />mwanki nakani muntu kalembolo lebakana mu nkwamusu zi tuna yena. Walutomini zaba yeno bende ti, mpasi zazozo Nzambi katutezila. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Mu ntangu yi tuba ku yeno, wa tuluteela ti nkwamusu twaayena, zazozo mpe zi tutudila, waluzeebi. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ni hahoho, bu nayena ti nalenda dyaka mu kingila ko, ni natambika Timote mu zaba bwedi bu kiminu kyeno. Nayena bunkuta ti Mutonti bewowo kalutonta, mpe kisalu kyeto kiiza kiba kimpamba.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Kansi Timote fumini ku yeno, wizi tula. Wutuyadidi mpolo zimbote zi kiminu kyeno na zi luzolo lweno. Wututedidi ti, luna tatamana mu tubambukilanga moyo mu misamu mimbote na luu na mpwila ye bwesa tuyena, bonso yeto mpe tuu na mpwila mu luyena. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ni hahoho zimpangi, ha kati di nkwamusu na mpasi zeto, tubeki nsyamusu mu yeno, mu dyambu di kiminu kyeno. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Ti tuna zinga bwabu, ni mu dyambu ti luu basyama nakekete mu Mfumu. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Bwedi tulendi vutudila matondo ku Nzambi mu dyambu dyeno, mu kyese kimvimba ki tuna yena mu yeno ha ntadisi yi Nzambi eto e? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Mpimpa na mwini, tuna tatamana mu sambila Nzambi eto, mwanki katuhaana hwahwa mu luyena dyaka na mu lungisa momomo malembolo ba neeno mu kiminu kyeno.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Bika yandi bende Nzambi, Tata dyeto na Mfumu eto Yesu, batuzibudila nzila mu kwiza kuu yeno! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Bika Mfumu katoma kudisa luzolo na kanyekisa lo mu yeno na yeno mpe ku bantu bamvimba, bonso luzolo luu neto mu yeno! <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Kakindisa mitima myeno, mwanki lulembolo ba na kibila na luba bavedila ha ntadisi yi Nzambi eto, Tata dyeto, mu kilumbu kyaavutuka Mfumu eto Yesu, na bantu bamvimba bakavwidi! Ameni!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nkadulu yikwe yangidikanga Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Zimpangi, bwabu lulongokidi kuu yeto bwedi nkadulu eno yifweti beela mu yangidika Nzambi. Ninga, bwabobo lukwe dyatilanga. Kansi bwabu, tuna lulomba mpe tuna lusyamisa mu nkumbu yi Mfumu Yesu: luvula bwe sa dyaka! <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Lutomini zaaba nkye zintumunu zifuma ku Mfumu Yesu tuluhaana. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Nzambi tiidi ti luba bantu balongo, mpe lulembolo bwa mu kinsuza. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Bika kadi muntu mu yeno kazaaba mu keba nitu andi mu zinga mu bulongo na mu buzitu, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />wulembolo ba ku nsye luyaalu lu nsatu zimbi, bonso bukwe sanga bantu balembolo zaba Nzambi, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />mu musamu bewuwu, muntu ka hidikandi misamu mimbi ku mpangi andi na ka muhunandi ko. Watuteka luteela, mpe tululwengisa ti: Mfumu kwe haananga nsembolo ku yobobo bakwe hidikanga myo. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Kadi Nzambi katutumisa mu zinga ku nsye busafu ko, kansi mu zinga ku nsye bulongo. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Ni hahoho, yondowo kwe nyafunanga ntumunu bezizi, kakwe nyafunanga muntu ko, kansi Nzambi kwe luhaananga Mpeve andi Yilongo.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Luu na nsatu ko ti tulusonikina mu myo mitadidi zola ku kimpangi, mu dyambu ti yeno bende lulongoka ku Nzambi mu zolasana yeno na yeno. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ni zola bekoko mpe, lukwe lonkisanga ku zimpangi zii ku kizunga kimvimba ki Masedwani. Kansi tuna lusyamisa zimpangi, luvula bwe sa dyaka! <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Sadileeno ngolo mu ba mu kiyenge, mu lembolo kota mu misamu mitadidi bantu bahiika, na musala mu moko meeno, bonso bu tuteka we lutuma. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Bwabobo ndyatulu eno yaabela yi buzitu ha meso ma bantu balembolo zaba Nzambi, mpe lulembolo ba kizitu ku muntu.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mvutukulu yi Mfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Zimpangi, tutiidi luzaba kikedika mu dyambu di bantu bebobo bafwa, mwanki lulembolo ba mu kyadi, bonso bantu bahiika balembolo ba na kivuvu. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Tala ti, tukwe kwikilanga ti Yesu wufwa na wufuluka mu bafwa, tukwe kwikilanga mpe ti Nzambi waatuula ha kimosi na Yesu, bantu bebobo bafwa mu kiminu mu Yesu.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Bonso buta Mfumu, tukwe tanga ti: yeto twaaba bamoyo natee haa kwiza Mfumu, twaatekidila yobobo bateka fwa ko. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ha yuwakana mbembo yingolo yi ntumunu na ndinga yi nkuluntu yi zimbazi, mpe muningu wu kulumenta di Nzambi, Mfumu yandi bende waakulumuka tuuka ku yulu mpe bantu bebobo bafwa mu Klisto baateka fuluka mu bafwa. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Mboki yeto twaaba bamoyo mu ntangu beyoyo, baatunata ha kimosi nawu mu matuti mu bwana Mfumu ku yulu, mpe twaaba na Mfumu ntangu zimvimba. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Syamasaneeno yeno na yeno mu mpova bezizi.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Zimpangi, mu dyambu ditadidi ntangu na kilokola, luu na nsatu ko ti tulusonikina dyaka mu musamu bewowo. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Mu dyambu ti, walutomini zaba yebende ti kilumbu kyaakwiza Mfumu kyaaba bonso bukwe kwizanga mwivi mu mpimpa. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Bantu bu baata ti: «Mu kiyenge na mu nkebolo tudi», baayitukulu, mpasi zinsisi zibabwididi bonso misongo bu mikwe bakilanga mukento weka lukufi mu buta, mpe nakani muntu kaavuka ko. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Kansi zimpangi, yeno luu mu kitombe ko, mpe kilumbu bekyokyo lwaayitukulu kyo bonso mwivi ko. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Yeno bamvimba luu bantu bakwe zinganga mu kya na mu mwini. Yeto tukwe zinganga mu mpimpa hoti mu tombe ko. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ni hahoho, tubwandi tolo bonso bahiika ko, kansi tukayeeno meso mpe tukiyaaleeno. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Mu dyambu ti, yobobo bakwe bwanga tolo, mpimpa bakwe lambalalanga, mpe yobobo bakwe kolongo malamu mpimpa bakwe kolongo. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Kansi yeto tuvwihulu ku kya, tukiyaaleeno. Tulwateeno kiminu bonso kinkutu ki kisengo kikwe kebanga ntulu, tulwateeno mpe luzolo na kivuvu ki mpulusu bonso mpu. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Mu dyambu ti Nzambi ka tusoola ko mwanki nganzi zandi zi tubwila, kansi tutambula mpulusu mu Yesu-Klisto, Mfumu eto, <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />wufwa mu dyambu dyeto, mwanki tuzinga kintwadi nandi, ni tuba bamoyo hoti bafwa. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ni hahoho, syamasaneeno mpe tungasaneeno yeno na yeno mu kintwadi, bonso bu luna sanga bo.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ntumunu na lusakumunu lu mansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Zimpangi, tuna lulomba mu zitisa yobobo bana salanga ha kati dyeno, bana lutwadisanga mu Mfumu, na bana lulwengisanga. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Balonkeeno ti luu na buzitu mpe luzolo lulwingi mu dyambu di kisalu ki bana sala. Mpe beeno mu kiyenge yeno na yeno.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Zimpangi, ebu tuna lulomba: Lwengisangeeno bantu balembolo ba na ludedomo, kindisangeeno yobobo balebakani, sadisangeeno yobobo baa na bunokina, bangangeeno na luvibudulu ku bamvimba. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Kebeeno kweno, muntu ka vutulandi mambi mu mambi ko, kansi tatamanangeeno mu hidika misamu mimbote yeno na yeno, mpe ku bantu bamvimba.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Yangalalangeeno ntangu zimvimba <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />sambilangeeno ntangu zimvimba, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />vutulangeeno matondo mu mimvimba. Mu dyambu ti, ludi luzolo lu Nzambi ha kati dyeno mu Yesu-Klisto.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Luzimandi tiya tu Mpeve Yilongo ko, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Luyinandi mbikudulu ko. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Kansi fyongoninangeeno mimvimba, simbidilangeeno myo mii mimbote, <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />mpe beeno kitatu mu misamu mimvimba mimbi.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Bika Nzambi yi kiyenge kalubyeka longo mu nkadulu eno yimvimba, bika ti Mpeve, mwela na nitu eno biba bilembolo dyambu dye semba natee mu kilumbu kyaavutuka Mfumu eto Yesu Klisto. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Yondowo wuna lutumisa wukwikama kadi, mimvimba mya kaahidika.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Zimpangi, tusambidilangeeno mpe.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Hanangeeno ku zimpangi zimvimba mbote ye bumbasana mu kimpangi.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Mu nkumbu yi Mfumu, nina lubombidila: tangeeno mukanda bewuwu ku zimpangi zeto zimvimba!<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Bika Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto kalusakumuna!<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>